OL,3,GNEWSADispersal zone in place after     
OL,4,Aanti-social behviour                   
OL,6,FMore police are patrolling an area hit 
OL,7,Fby anti-social behaviour and criminal  
OL,8,Fdamage over recent days.               
OL,10,FMerseyside Police said it had brought  
OL,11,Fin a dispersal zone in Liscard,        
OL,12,FWallasey, which gives the force the    
OL,13,Fpower to tell people they suspect are  
OL,14,Fcausing "nuisance" to leave the area   
OL,15,Ffor 48 hours.                          
OL,17,FAs well as extra patrols, the order,   
OL,18,Fwhich will remain in place until 19:00 
OL,19,FGMT on Monday, means the officers can  
OL,20,Fseize vehicles or any other item being 
OL,21,Fused in anti-social behaviour.         
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
