OL,3,GNEWSADispersal zone in place after     
OL,4,Aanti-social behviour                   
OL,6,FResponse Inspector Garth Kobras said   
OL,7,Fthere had been reports of assaults and 
OL,8,Fcriminal damage in Liscard over the    
OL,9,Fpast two days, and the order would give
OL,10,Fthe force an "additional tool" to      
OL,11,Fdisrupt such activities.               
